cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Playhead in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Playhead: overview curves and analysis-driven tools for music and game audio"
abstract: >-
  Playhead is an alternative waveform overview: it adds what a sound is doing
  (intensity, character, rhythm, structure) to the waveform as curves, marks
  and a spectrogram on one time axis, composed into strips from short look
  codes, and uses the same analysis to drive editing, mixing and sound-design
  tools that act on the events it finds. It runs entirely in the browser.
